OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fcloudier over northern Scotland this
OL,7,Fevening and tonight with a few light
OL,8,Fshowers. Elsewhere, a chilly night
OL,9,Fwith prolonged clear spells and the
OL,10,Fodd mist or fog patch forming in rural
OL,11,Fareas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FHigh pressure brings another
OL,14,Fsettled and largely dry day with sunny
OL,15,Fspells, variable cloud and light
OL,16,Fwinds. An isolated shower possible
OL,17,Fnear northern coasts. Temperatures a
OL,18,Flittle higher than Saturday.
